        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: What Lovers Do, 1.22.03.Acoustic\n- People: Adam Levine, Jesse Carmichael, Mickey Madden, James Valentine, Matt Flynn, PJ Morton\n- Organizations: Maroon 5\n- Places: Hit Factory, New York\n\nFacts:\n- Maroon 5 is a Californian band.\n- 1.22.03.Acoustic is a live EP by Maroon 5.\n- 1.22.03.Acoustic was named for the date it was recorded live at the Hit Factory in New York.\n- What Lovers Do was released on August 30, 2017, as the third single from Maroon 5's upcoming sixth studio album.\n- Maroon 5 currently consists of lead vocalist Adam Levine, keyboardist and rhythm guitarist Jesse Carmichael, bassist Mickey Madden, lead guitarist James Valentine, drummer Matt Flynn, and keyboardist PJ Morton.",
